From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:18:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: describe the trackpad
 actuator again

The trackpad's haptic actuator (J604 ADT
/arm-io/dockchannel-mtp/mtp-transport/actuator) went with the second MTP
block of t8132-j604.dts when the series was rebuilt on
integration/aurora: t8132-laptop.dtsi now brings the rest of that block.
Without the node dockchannel-hid ignores the interface the coprocessor
announces, so there is no Force Touch actuator.

Add it to the J604's MTP HID node, as the J613 and the other Aurora
laptops have it.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
index 7006ff2f38..3a746c5916 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
@@ -338,6 +338,10 @@ &mtp_hid {
 	multi-touch {
 		firmware-name = "apple/tpmtfw-j604.bin";
 	};
+
+	/* J604 ADT /arm-io/dockchannel-mtp/mtp-transport/actuator: Force Touch */
+	actuator {
+	};
 };
 
